BEHAVIOR map-buf-size

DESCRIPTION
  Bytes a caller must provide to back a hash map of `cap` slots: an 8-byte
  header ([cap:8]) plus cap * 337-byte slots (slot = used:1 + key_len:8 +
  key:64 + val_len:8 + val:256). Use it to size the MEMORY region for map-*.

CONTRACT
  INPUT cap int 8
  OUTPUT size int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH 694a01ba

IMPLEMENTATION
  cv = LOAD cap 8
  e = IMUL cv 337 8
  s = IADD e 8 8
  STORE size s 8
END
